{"parentUuid":"3d909922-801c-4bc8-a0ff-95b7380f3b3c","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a37f3a34aafca097d","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01Bvd8PhxvUAB3GsH8HDcbAu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have everything I need to write the verification checklist. Let me confirm the KL function direction matches the writeup's claim of KL(clean||patched) one more time by reading the exact lines, then compile.\n\nKey code facts confirmed:\n- j8 `kltot(p,q)`: `lp=log_softmax(p)`, `lq=log_softmax(q)`, returns `(lp.exp()*(lp-lq)).sum(-1).sum()` = KL(p||q) summed over positions, called as `kltot(hclean, run_fra(...))` → KL(clean||patched). ✓ correct sign.\n- FRA hook: `s[0,Hh,:seq,:seq]-=sd` on `hook_attn_scores` where `sd = delta*c`, delta built from `pairs_delta`/`fra_delta` summing `d[\"vv\"]` (the bilinear FRA values) for selected `(i,j)` pairs at edge `(qi,ki)`. ✓ content-addressed bilinear subtraction.\n- ActAdd: `act[0,p,:] -= s*vX*act[0,p,:].norm()` on `hook_resid_pre`, `vX` = (resid at cue/key pos − mean) normalized. ✓ linear residual steer scaled by local norm.\n\nLet me verify the j8 ActAdd \"cue-identity\" vs \"prev-was-cue\" direction construction and application positions one more time precisely."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":911,"cache_read_input_tokens":67465,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":911,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CbuFiVGpSbwpNx2zhNSjk","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"ed9c97e2-3c83-466a-843b-327866a420e6","timestamp":"2026-06-10T08:21:39.316Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/dmitrymanning-coe/Documents/Research/FRA/fra_proj/experiments/fra_win","sessionId":"8a660228-bde0-4e60-bfe2-aafb33fe0b4d","version":"2.1.170","gitBranch":"aut